{"page":575,"width":1670,"height":2538,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"638","words":[{"text":"638","x":167,"y":147,"width":57,"height":29}]},{"text":"Chapter 14 파일 시스템 구현","words":[{"text":"Chapter","x":293,"y":149,"width":113,"height":27},{"text":"14","x":420,"y":150,"width":34,"height":21},{"text":"파일","x":482,"y":150,"width":41,"height":24},{"text":"시스템","x":533,"y":150,"width":62,"height":25},{"text":"구현","x":604,"y":151,"width":41,"height":24}]},{"text":"일부가 inode에 할당되어 있다. 그렇지만 inode를 미리 할당하고 또한 이들을 파티션","words":[{"text":"일부가","x":296,"y":271,"width":90,"height":35},{"text":"inode에","x":398,"y":272,"width":115,"height":35},{"text":"할당되어","x":529,"y":272,"width":114,"height":36},{"text":"있다.","x":661,"y":272,"width":63,"height":35},{"text":"그렇지만","x":740,"y":272,"width":120,"height":35},{"text":"inode를","x":873,"y":274,"width":120,"height":34},{"text":"미리","x":1008,"y":273,"width":57,"height":35},{"text":"할당하고","x":1083,"y":273,"width":130,"height":36},{"text":"또한","x":1229,"y":274,"width":66,"height":35},{"text":"이들을","x":1310,"y":273,"width":98,"height":36},{"text":"파티션","x":1424,"y":273,"width":90,"height":37}]},{"text":"전체에 분산 할당함으로써, 파일 시스템의 성능을 항상할 수 있다. 이러한 성능 개선은","words":[{"text":"전체에","x":295,"y":329,"width":87,"height":34},{"text":"분산","x":398,"y":329,"width":61,"height":34},{"text":"할당함으로써,","x":472,"y":330,"width":184,"height":36},{"text":"파일","x":672,"y":330,"width":56,"height":35},{"text":"시스템의","x":746,"y":330,"width":114,"height":35},{"text":"성능을","x":880,"y":330,"width":89,"height":36},{"text":"항상할","x":983,"y":330,"width":95,"height":37},{"text":"수","x":1091,"y":332,"width":33,"height":35},{"text":"있다.","x":1140,"y":331,"width":70,"height":36},{"text":"이러한","x":1230,"y":332,"width":99,"height":36},{"text":"성능","x":1344,"y":331,"width":65,"height":36},{"text":"개선은","x":1425,"y":331,"width":91,"height":36}]},{"text":"inode%-* 가급적 데이터 블록 부근에 위치히도록 함으로써 디스크의 탐색 시간을 줄인","words":[{"text":"inode%-*","x":293,"y":387,"width":149,"height":35},{"text":"가급적","x":454,"y":387,"width":85,"height":36},{"text":"데이터","x":554,"y":389,"width":83,"height":35},{"text":"블록","x":652,"y":389,"width":59,"height":34},{"text":"부근에","x":721,"y":388,"width":87,"height":35},{"text":"위치히도록","x":822,"y":388,"width":152,"height":36},{"text":"함으로써","x":985,"y":389,"width":122,"height":35},{"text":"디스크의","x":1125,"y":389,"width":127,"height":35},{"text":"탐색","x":1267,"y":389,"width":63,"height":35},{"text":"시간을","x":1348,"y":389,"width":96,"height":35},{"text":"줄인","x":1455,"y":391,"width":59,"height":33}]},{"text":"것에 기인한다.","words":[{"text":"것에","x":296,"y":446,"width":55,"height":35},{"text":"기인한다.","x":367,"y":445,"width":125,"height":35}]},{"text":"또 다른 예로서, 14.4절에서 살펴본 클러스터링 기법을 다시 고려해 보자. 이 기법은","words":[{"text":"또","x":350,"y":508,"width":30,"height":26},{"text":"다른","x":392,"y":504,"width":60,"height":35},{"text":"예로서,","x":464,"y":504,"width":94,"height":35},{"text":"14.4절에서","x":572,"y":504,"width":143,"height":35},{"text":"살펴본","x":730,"y":504,"width":89,"height":35},{"text":"클러스터링","x":830,"y":504,"width":149,"height":36},{"text":"기법을","x":996,"y":505,"width":93,"height":35},{"text":"다시","x":1101,"y":505,"width":61,"height":36},{"text":"고려해","x":1178,"y":505,"width":97,"height":36},{"text":"보자.","x":1290,"y":505,"width":74,"height":35},{"text":"이","x":1381,"y":504,"width":26,"height":36},{"text":"기법은","x":1425,"y":504,"width":91,"height":36}]},{"text":"내부 단편회를 허용하는 대신 파일 탐색과 파일 전송 성능을 항상한다. 내부 단편회를","words":[{"text":"내부","x":294,"y":562,"width":60,"height":35},{"text":"단편회를","x":369,"y":562,"width":120,"height":35},{"text":"허용하는","x":504,"y":562,"width":117,"height":35},{"text":"대신","x":636,"y":562,"width":55,"height":35},{"text":"파일","x":707,"y":562,"width":57,"height":35},{"text":"탐색과","x":781,"y":562,"width":90,"height":36},{"text":"파일","x":885,"y":563,"width":59,"height":35},{"text":"전송","x":963,"y":563,"width":60,"height":35},{"text":"성능을","x":1040,"y":563,"width":95,"height":35},{"text":"항상한다.","x":1150,"y":563,"width":140,"height":36},{"text":"내부","x":1310,"y":563,"width":65,"height":35},{"text":"단편회를","x":1391,"y":563,"width":124,"height":35}]},{"text":"최소화하기 위해서 BSD UNIX에서는 파일의 그기가 증가힘에 따라 클러스터의 크기도","words":[{"text":"최소화하기","x":293,"y":620,"width":148,"height":36},{"text":"위해서","x":457,"y":620,"width":84,"height":35},{"text":"BSD","x":555,"y":624,"width":63,"height":27},{"text":"UNIX에서는","x":629,"y":619,"width":179,"height":36},{"text":"파일의","x":819,"y":620,"width":88,"height":36},{"text":"그기가","x":922,"y":620,"width":93,"height":36},{"text":"증가힘에","x":1026,"y":621,"width":125,"height":35},{"text":"따라","x":1167,"y":621,"width":67,"height":35},{"text":"클러스터의","x":1245,"y":621,"width":163,"height":35},{"text":"크기도","x":1424,"y":620,"width":91,"height":36}]},{"text":"변화시길 수 있다. 전부 채울 수 있는 경우에는 큰 클러스터를 시용하고, 작은 클러스터","words":[{"text":"변화시길","x":293,"y":678,"width":119,"height":35},{"text":"수","x":427,"y":680,"width":31,"height":34},{"text":"있다.","x":471,"y":678,"width":63,"height":35},{"text":"전부","x":550,"y":678,"width":57,"height":34},{"text":"채울","x":620,"y":678,"width":58,"height":34},{"text":"수","x":689,"y":678,"width":30,"height":34},{"text":"있는","x":733,"y":678,"width":58,"height":34},{"text":"경우에는","x":805,"y":678,"width":120,"height":36},{"text":"큰","x":937,"y":681,"width":31,"height":31},{"text":"클러스터를","x":981,"y":679,"width":160,"height":34},{"text":"시용하고,","x":1154,"y":680,"width":141,"height":35},{"text":"작은","x":1311,"y":680,"width":67,"height":34},{"text":"클러스터","x":1390,"y":679,"width":121,"height":36}]},{"text":"는 작은 파일들과 파일의 마지막 클러스터를 위해 이용된다. 이러한 시스템은 부록 C에","words":[{"text":"는","x":290,"y":737,"width":32,"height":33},{"text":"작은","x":334,"y":736,"width":62,"height":34},{"text":"파일들과","x":408,"y":737,"width":119,"height":35},{"text":"파일의","x":538,"y":736,"width":85,"height":35},{"text":"마지막","x":638,"y":736,"width":89,"height":35},{"text":"클러스터를","x":738,"y":736,"width":151,"height":35},{"text":"위해","x":902,"y":736,"width":58,"height":35},{"text":"이용된다.","x":976,"y":737,"width":132,"height":35},{"text":"이러한","x":1126,"y":737,"width":98,"height":35},{"text":"시스템은","x":1238,"y":738,"width":133,"height":35},{"text":"부록","x":1384,"y":738,"width":64,"height":35},{"text":"C에","x":1459,"y":738,"width":53,"height":35}]},{"text":"서 기술된다.","words":[{"text":"서","x":291,"y":794,"width":26,"height":35},{"text":"기술된다.","x":333,"y":794,"width":128,"height":36}]},{"text":"또한 고려해야 할 사항으로 파일의 디렉터리(또는 mode) 항목 내에 저장되어야 할","words":[{"text":"또한","x":347,"y":853,"width":62,"height":34},{"text":"고려해야","x":421,"y":853,"width":119,"height":35},{"text":"할","x":550,"y":853,"width":31,"height":34},{"text":"사항으로","x":592,"y":853,"width":117,"height":35},{"text":"파일의","x":721,"y":852,"width":86,"height":36},{"text":"디렉터리(또는","x":824,"y":852,"width":196,"height":38},{"text":"mode)","x":1032,"y":856,"width":103,"height":35},{"text":"항목","x":1150,"y":854,"width":68,"height":34},{"text":"내에","x":1232,"y":854,"width":62,"height":35},{"text":"저장되어야","x":1312,"y":854,"width":161,"height":35},{"text":"할","x":1484,"y":855,"width":31,"height":34}]},{"text":"정보의 종류가 있다. 예를 들어, 많은 시스템은 파일의 마지막 쓰기 시각을 기록하여 사","words":[{"text":"정보의","x":291,"y":911,"width":87,"height":35},{"text":"종류가","x":393,"y":911,"width":92,"height":35},{"text":"있다.","x":498,"y":911,"width":63,"height":34},{"text":"예를","x":576,"y":911,"width":58,"height":34},{"text":"들어,","x":646,"y":910,"width":65,"height":36},{"text":"많은","x":726,"y":910,"width":60,"height":34},{"text":"시스템은","x":798,"y":910,"width":122,"height":35},{"text":"파일의","x":932,"y":911,"width":90,"height":35},{"text":"마지막","x":1039,"y":912,"width":97,"height":35},{"text":"쓰기","x":1149,"y":913,"width":62,"height":35},{"text":"시각을","x":1230,"y":913,"width":100,"height":34},{"text":"기록하여","x":1345,"y":913,"width":123,"height":35},{"text":"사","x":1485,"y":914,"width":30,"height":35}]},{"text":"용자에게 그 정보를 제공하고 또한 그 파일을 백업할지를 결정히는 데 시용한다. 어떤","words":[{"text":"용자에게","x":288,"y":969,"width":120,"height":35},{"text":"그","x":425,"y":974,"width":30,"height":24},{"text":"정보를","x":472,"y":969,"width":86,"height":34},{"text":"제공하고","x":574,"y":969,"width":114,"height":35},{"text":"또한","x":703,"y":968,"width":61,"height":33},{"text":"그","x":776,"y":973,"width":31,"height":23},{"text":"파일을","x":821,"y":969,"width":92,"height":34},{"text":"백업할지를","x":928,"y":969,"width":158,"height":36},{"text":"결정히는","x":1103,"y":970,"width":131,"height":36},{"text":"데","x":1250,"y":971,"width":28,"height":35},{"text":"시용한다.","x":1298,"y":971,"width":138,"height":35},{"text":"어떤","x":1455,"y":971,"width":58,"height":35}]},{"text":"시스템은 마지막 접근 시간을 저장하여 사용자가 마지막으로 파일이 읽혔던 시간을 알","words":[{"text":"시스템은","x":291,"y":1027,"width":120,"height":35},{"text":"마지막","x":424,"y":1027,"width":90,"height":35},{"text":"접근","x":528,"y":1027,"width":58,"height":34},{"text":"시간을","x":599,"y":1027,"width":88,"height":35},{"text":"저장하여","x":701,"y":1026,"width":115,"height":36},{"text":"사용자가","x":833,"y":1027,"width":124,"height":36},{"text":"마지막으로","x":970,"y":1028,"width":161,"height":35},{"text":"파일이","x":1146,"y":1029,"width":95,"height":35},{"text":"읽혔던","x":1263,"y":1029,"width":95,"height":34},{"text":"시간을","x":1376,"y":1029,"width":95,"height":35},{"text":"알","x":1485,"y":1031,"width":29,"height":34}]},{"text":"수 있게 한다. 그 경우 파일이 읽힐 때마다 이 필드가 매번 갱신되어야 한다. 이렇게 니","words":[{"text":"수","x":288,"y":1087,"width":32,"height":33},{"text":"있게","x":334,"y":1085,"width":56,"height":35},{"text":"한다.","x":405,"y":1085,"width":66,"height":35},{"text":"그","x":485,"y":1090,"width":30,"height":23},{"text":"경우","x":529,"y":1085,"width":58,"height":35},{"text":"파일이","x":599,"y":1085,"width":85,"height":35},{"text":"읽힐","x":702,"y":1085,"width":55,"height":34},{"text":"때마다","x":774,"y":1086,"width":90,"height":34},{"text":"이","x":878,"y":1087,"width":25,"height":34},{"text":"필드가","x":922,"y":1086,"width":93,"height":35},{"text":"매번","x":1028,"y":1087,"width":63,"height":35},{"text":"갱신되어야","x":1108,"y":1087,"width":164,"height":35},{"text":"한다.","x":1285,"y":1087,"width":73,"height":35},{"text":"이렇게","x":1377,"y":1088,"width":91,"height":34},{"text":"니","x":1485,"y":1089,"width":24,"height":35}]},{"text":"렉터리를 갱신하려면 먼저 메모리로 그 디렉터리(디렉터리가 들어 있는 블록)를 읽어와","words":[{"text":"렉터리를","x":290,"y":1144,"width":120,"height":35},{"text":"갱신하려면","x":424,"y":1143,"width":144,"height":35},{"text":"먼저","x":584,"y":1144,"width":53,"height":34},{"text":"메모리로","x":654,"y":1144,"width":119,"height":34},{"text":"그","x":785,"y":1149,"width":30,"height":23},{"text":"디렉터리(디렉터리가","x":829,"y":1144,"width":295,"height":39},{"text":"들어","x":1136,"y":1146,"width":62,"height":34},{"text":"있는","x":1219,"y":1146,"width":64,"height":34},{"text":"블록)를","x":1296,"y":1145,"width":112,"height":38},{"text":"읽어와","x":1424,"y":1145,"width":90,"height":37}]},{"text":"야 하고 거기에 방금 읽은 시간을 기록해야 하며 그 디렉터리를 다시 장치로 써야만 한","words":[{"text":"야","x":289,"y":1203,"width":31,"height":34},{"text":"하고","x":332,"y":1202,"width":59,"height":35},{"text":"거기에","x":406,"y":1202,"width":85,"height":35},{"text":"방금","x":506,"y":1202,"width":59,"height":35},{"text":"읽은","x":579,"y":1202,"width":58,"height":35},{"text":"시간을","x":649,"y":1202,"width":90,"height":35},{"text":"기록해야","x":752,"y":1202,"width":121,"height":36},{"text":"하며","x":886,"y":1203,"width":57,"height":35},{"text":"그","x":961,"y":1208,"width":30,"height":23},{"text":"디렉터리를","x":1006,"y":1203,"width":161,"height":35},{"text":"다시","x":1181,"y":1203,"width":62,"height":35},{"text":"장치로","x":1261,"y":1203,"width":99,"height":35},{"text":"써야만","x":1376,"y":1203,"width":96,"height":36},{"text":"한","x":1483,"y":1205,"width":31,"height":33}]},{"text":"다. 파일을 읽을 때마다 이러한 디렉터리 기록 작업을 해야 한다면 꽤 번거롭고 오버헤","words":[{"text":"다.","x":289,"y":1261,"width":36,"height":35},{"text":"파일을","x":340,"y":1260,"width":91,"height":36},{"text":"읽을","x":445,"y":1261,"width":58,"height":34},{"text":"때마다","x":516,"y":1261,"width":88,"height":35},{"text":"이러한","x":618,"y":1261,"width":88,"height":35},{"text":"디렉터리","x":720,"y":1261,"width":116,"height":35},{"text":"기록","x":855,"y":1262,"width":60,"height":34},{"text":"작업을","x":928,"y":1261,"width":95,"height":35},{"text":"해야","x":1036,"y":1262,"width":65,"height":34},{"text":"한다면","x":1113,"y":1261,"width":98,"height":35},{"text":"꽤","x":1227,"y":1261,"width":30,"height":35},{"text":"번거롭고","x":1276,"y":1261,"width":131,"height":35},{"text":"오버헤","x":1420,"y":1262,"width":91,"height":36}]},{"text":"드(overhead)도 상당히 크므로 시스템 설계자는 과연 이러한 정보가 진짜 필요한 것인","words":[{"text":"드(overhead)도","x":288,"y":1322,"width":225,"height":35},{"text":"상당히","x":525,"y":1319,"width":85,"height":36},{"text":"크므로","x":625,"y":1323,"width":90,"height":26},{"text":"시스템","x":727,"y":1320,"width":87,"height":34},{"text":"설계자는","x":831,"y":1320,"width":122,"height":35},{"text":"과연","x":964,"y":1320,"width":62,"height":34},{"text":"이러한","x":1042,"y":1319,"width":96,"height":36},{"text":"정보가","x":1152,"y":1320,"width":98,"height":34},{"text":"진짜","x":1264,"y":1319,"width":66,"height":34},{"text":"필요한","x":1344,"y":1320,"width":97,"height":33},{"text":"것인","x":1454,"y":1320,"width":58,"height":34}]},{"text":"지를 잘 결정하여야 한다. 일반적으로 파일과 연관된 모든 데이터 항은 효율과 성능에","words":[{"text":"지를","x":289,"y":1378,"width":60,"height":34},{"text":"잘","x":363,"y":1378,"width":30,"height":34},{"text":"결정하여야","x":409,"y":1378,"width":147,"height":36},{"text":"한다.","x":568,"y":1378,"width":66,"height":36},{"text":"일반적으로","x":653,"y":1378,"width":147,"height":35},{"text":"파일과","x":815,"y":1378,"width":93,"height":35},{"text":"연관된","x":924,"y":1378,"width":90,"height":34},{"text":"모든","x":1030,"y":1380,"width":65,"height":32},{"text":"데이터","x":1110,"y":1377,"width":94,"height":35},{"text":"항은","x":1224,"y":1377,"width":66,"height":35},{"text":"효율과","x":1306,"y":1377,"width":100,"height":35},{"text":"성능에","x":1421,"y":1377,"width":89,"height":36}]},{"text":"대한 영향을 고려해야만 한다.","words":[{"text":"대한","x":289,"y":1437,"width":60,"height":35},{"text":"영향을","x":361,"y":1436,"width":88,"height":35},{"text":"고려해야만","x":459,"y":1437,"width":149,"height":35},{"text":"한다.","x":617,"y":1437,"width":66,"height":35}]},{"text":"예를 들어, 데이터에 접근하기 위해 시용되는 포인터의 그기가 효율성에 얼마나 영","words":[{"text":"예를","x":345,"y":1495,"width":59,"height":35},{"text":"들어,","x":416,"y":1496,"width":68,"height":35},{"text":"데이터에","x":499,"y":1496,"width":114,"height":35},{"text":"접근하기","x":630,"y":1496,"width":114,"height":35},{"text":"위해","x":762,"y":1495,"width":57,"height":36},{"text":"시용되는","x":835,"y":1494,"width":124,"height":36},{"text":"포인터의","x":971,"y":1494,"width":125,"height":35},{"text":"그기가","x":1113,"y":1494,"width":100,"height":35},{"text":"효율성에","x":1226,"y":1493,"width":130,"height":35},{"text":"얼마나","x":1376,"y":1494,"width":95,"height":35},{"text":"영","x":1486,"y":1496,"width":23,"height":34}]},{"text":"향을 미치는지 고려해 보자. 대부분의 시스템은 32 또는 64비트를 시용한다. 32비트 포","words":[{"text":"향을","x":288,"y":1555,"width":61,"height":34},{"text":"미치는지","x":361,"y":1554,"width":115,"height":35},{"text":"고려해","x":491,"y":1555,"width":87,"height":35},{"text":"보자.","x":592,"y":1555,"width":65,"height":35},{"text":"대부분의","x":673,"y":1554,"width":116,"height":35},{"text":"시스템은","x":805,"y":1554,"width":122,"height":34},{"text":"32","x":938,"y":1557,"width":35,"height":27},{"text":"또는","x":988,"y":1555,"width":64,"height":31},{"text":"64비트를","x":1064,"y":1553,"width":136,"height":34},{"text":"시용한다.","x":1213,"y":1552,"width":140,"height":35},{"text":"32비트","x":1369,"y":1553,"width":102,"height":35},{"text":"포","x":1483,"y":1558,"width":29,"height":25}]},{"text":"인터를 사용하게 되면 파일의 크기가 232 (4 GB)로 제한된다. 64비트 포인터를 사용하","words":[{"text":"인터를","x":289,"y":1613,"width":89,"height":34},{"text":"사용하게","x":390,"y":1613,"width":117,"height":35},{"text":"되면","x":523,"y":1614,"width":57,"height":34},{"text":"파일의","x":594,"y":1614,"width":86,"height":34},{"text":"크기가","x":696,"y":1613,"width":91,"height":35},{"text":"232","x":798,"y":1609,"width":42,"height":34},{"text":"(4","x":855,"y":1615,"width":27,"height":34},{"text":"GB)로","x":896,"y"